   "evidence": "Lines 213-216; the only Bessel-specific inputs are the hypotheses, and it is applied twice (lines 235, 261) purely as a removable-singularity continuation step. The PR already extracted `Function.Even.odd_deriv` into its own public file on exactly this reasoning.",
