   "issue": "`private lemma eq_zero_of_mul_eq_zero {f : \u211d \u2192 \u211d} (hf : Continuous f) (h : \u2200 y, y * f y = 0) (x : \u211d) : f x = 0` mentions only upstream types (`\u211d`, `Continuous`) and its proof (`Continuous.ext_on (dense_compl_singleton 0)`) has nothing to do with Bessel functions. It is general infrastructure hidden as `private`.",
